    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Deelór ur ar Pasaáka tleehhaak qoomár slahhángwdá' ta babay Abibu, as AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng, asma slahhángw Abibu AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng kuungá' qoomár xweeraawo nuna baraá yaamaá Misrír wa duúx. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' ilahhooár Pasaáka ar muruú ta tsu/i haniisaak baraá tla/ángw bee/angwhúng nee hikwaahúng wa ale, as AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Munguúhúng kuwa ilaiwawa/a' didaádá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa tsawaár ar umuuwós kuwa ateetin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilahhooarí ma al/ayaara' nee mikaátér taa sluuftís. Deelo faanqwe mikaátér taa sluuftisiiká na /ayaak, inós kan babay mikaatér slahh'eemis, asma kuungá' ana gaanslár ti'ité' baraá yaamaá Misriro, gawaá adoorihe, deelo sleémeero kuungá' deeloodá' tawa baraá yaamaá Misrír wá ti'ité' an inslasleerá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Har afiqoomár deelo faanqw hee baraá yaamuuhunge gadaádá' mikaáte kar sluuftimisi mingiwa baáts baraá do'ós, nee fu'unaá makiito'oodá' taa gaás tsiindaá bál Pasaáka kuwa iimu/u/uunda', mindiwa meetiyé' baraá do' ay matlaatle.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Ilahhooár Pasaáka ar muruú ta tsu/i ma tawó hanmiisara' baraá gixsadu sleémeero kudá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng naa qoo haniisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala ilahhooa hanmiisaak didá' kilós ar AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng aa tsawaár as umuuwós kuwa didá' wa ateetin, diirí an didá' ilahhooár Pasaáka ar muruú ta tsu/i kawa hanmisa' tsiindoowo, qoomár looa bir darát, qoomaadár kilá' niwa baraá yaamaá Misrír wa ti'iité'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fu'unaydá' ki humiindá' nee ki /agá' didá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Munguúhúng aa tsawaár kuungá' wa ale, matlaatleero ta ki/á' baraá heemaduhúng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ar har afiqoomár deelo lahhooe mikaátér taa sluuftisiiká an /agá', nee bál faanqw a baalár ur ar muu iwa burumburiti as AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kuwa sluufmiisi, nee baalaadae ma gadiyuusara'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Kuungá' wiikidaá faanqw faaraak. Faaro dír kawa iimu/uunda' a qoomár fiiqit bura iimu/uundé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo deelór ur ar wiikidu ka boo/esá' as AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng kuwa ilaiwawa/a' ar ilahhooár sla'aari kawa hanisa' ar harqoomoó adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng nura tsuúq. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' tari dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng wa qwalala/á', kuungá' dinkwa nee na/iihúng awa daaqaay nee awa dasuuwo, nee lawaalehúng ar hhawaate nee ar /ameenaaro, nee hoomár ayaahúng hoota, nee dahaayero, nee na/aá panaay nee /ameenár kwaeeli ar ar alhootá' nee kuungá'. Adoorí tleehhaak didá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng aa tsawaár as umuuwós kuwa didá' wa ateetin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tí inslawaak, adór kuungá' aáng tar lawaale baraá yaamaá Misriro, gimsé' kaahirí ló'wa harmagahhaak kawa ota'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
