          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Alaá balangwhúng sleémeero slahhto bura hhe'esé', nee mamaá sabiíbu tsoo/aro bira hhe'esé', deelór ur ar Isleeri boo/eesaak deelo faanqwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' deeloosíng ur ka saqwalala/á' dinkwa nee na/iihúng awa daaqaay nee awa dasu, nee lawaalerhúng ar hhawaate nee ar /ameenaaro, nee múk Laáwi, nee dahaaye, nee na/aá panaay nee /ameenár kwaeeli nee hoomár baraá ayaahúng hoota. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deelo faanqwe AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng un deelór úr i tlehhá', didá' inós aa tsawaár as umuuwós kuwa didá' wa teetin, asma kuungá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng nu tsuuq baraá balangwhúng sleémeero, nee baraá gadiyeduuhúng sleémeero, kuungá' tari ló'wa qwala/á'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Hhawaate sleémeero awa xoororhúng ni hardihiyá' dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng, ki/ima tám, umuú kurko didá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng aa tsawaari as umuuwós kuwa didá' wa ateetin: Qoomár deelór ur ar Pasaáka, nee deelór ur ar bu'uungw, nee deelór ur ar Isleeri. Mindiwa dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i hardihiyé' ar dabaá kaaharen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuú heewo gaa ngi haniisi ar adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng nura tsuúq.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Kuungá' har'ohuuse nee geeraharuuseero tsawaaraak baraá tlahhi'iihúng wa ale, baraá gixsaduhúng kudá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng naa haniisi, inooín qaa/oó muu ngu tlaaqiye' ar adór ganaá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gár heé wa hariim ma qwaareesara', nee muu mu barqaantusara', tam slukuma ma /ayaara', asma slukuma heé gár ganaa' ga tsatsahhaám gun iimigiwísh, nee hariimár heé ganaá' gan qwaarés. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muruú ganaá' kilós na ló'wa harmagahhaak kuwa tleehhi as kahhó' tawa hota' baraá yaamaá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng ni haniisi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
